      from the SCF calculation. In case the first step is a DFT calculation these two might be different.

NOTE: For the SCF part we extrapolate based on the scheme proposed
        in J. Chem. Phys. 2008, 129, 184116
      using the exponents from J. Chem. Theory Comput., 7, 33-43 (2011)

NOTE: For the correlation part we extrapolate based on the scheme proposed
        in J. Chem. Phys. 1997, 106, 9639
      using the exponents from J. Chem. Theory Comput., 7, 33-43 (2011)


